WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.270 --> 00:00:03.419
- Sometimes in my life I'm
like oh my frickin' God!

00:00:03.419 --> 00:00:04.821
What is going on?

00:00:04.821 --> 00:00:07.492
And I feel like that's
what my Instagram's like.

00:00:07.492 --> 00:00:09.642
(hinges squeaking)
(upbeat music)

00:00:09.642 --> 00:00:12.273
Today all us awkward guys are gonna learn

00:00:12.273 --> 00:00:14.885
how to finally pose like Instagram models.

00:00:14.885 --> 00:00:16.463
- The only attempt I've
ever tried to be a model

00:00:16.463 --> 00:00:18.333
I'm wearing at least two GoPros,

00:00:18.333 --> 00:00:19.749
I've got the sorority hand out.

00:00:19.749 --> 00:00:21.228
- Basically I have one pose.

00:00:21.228 --> 00:00:22.886
Sit close to a window with good lighting

00:00:22.886 --> 00:00:25.106
and raise my eyebrow kind of like this.

00:00:25.106 --> 00:00:26.777
That's the only thing
that I know how to do.

00:00:26.777 --> 00:00:29.271
- When I was in Disneyland,
I should be more excited

00:00:29.271 --> 00:00:30.809
but literally the picture's,

00:00:30.809 --> 00:00:32.495
a picture of me standing like this.

00:00:32.495 --> 00:00:34.130
It's the most miserable picture.

00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:36.595
- If someone whips out
a camera my go to pose

00:00:36.595 --> 00:00:40.107
is just my hand in my pocket
and then just a cheesy smile.

00:00:40.107 --> 00:00:41.848
(upbeat music)

00:00:41.848 --> 00:00:43.382
They look like the have
their life together.

00:00:43.382 --> 00:00:45.304
They're always on the street, on the go.

00:00:45.304 --> 00:00:48.291
- A lot of them do the #OOTD.

00:00:48.291 --> 00:00:50.569
- Instagram bloggers are
usually really stylish

00:00:50.569 --> 00:00:52.817
and they're always looking
off into the distance,

00:00:52.817 --> 00:00:53.896
contemplating life.

00:00:53.896 --> 00:00:55.985
- Kind of remind me of Ryan Gosling.

00:00:55.985 --> 00:00:57.811
- I think Instagram fashion bloggers

00:00:57.811 --> 00:01:00.039
make their lives look a lot
better than they actually are.

00:01:00.039 --> 00:01:02.462
- They make it look easy but
I'm sure it's a lot harder

00:01:02.462 --> 00:01:03.730
and more complicated.

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:05.970
- Today we have Devy, an
Instagram photographer

00:01:05.970 --> 00:01:07.320
teaching us how to pose.

00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:09.123
- So there are only a handful of poses

00:01:09.123 --> 00:01:11.182
that Instagram fashion models do.

00:01:11.182 --> 00:01:12.755
The three poses are: casual lean,

00:01:12.755 --> 00:01:13.588
the mid-walk,

00:01:13.588 --> 00:01:16.176
the adjusting your clothes.

00:01:16.176 --> 00:01:17.918
Pose number one is a casual lean

00:01:17.918 --> 00:01:20.182
so basically just to
show that you're relaxed

00:01:20.182 --> 00:01:21.767
while showing off your clothes.

00:01:21.767 --> 00:01:23.791
- Leaning was a bit of a challenge

00:01:23.791 --> 00:01:25.362
'cause I feel like I don't wanna look

00:01:25.362 --> 00:01:26.592
like I was uncomfortable.

00:01:26.592 --> 00:01:28.758
At first to be honest,
it felt really forced

00:01:28.758 --> 00:01:30.710
and I was kind of like, oh I'm
not sure I'm gonna like those

00:01:30.710 --> 00:01:31.946
and it showed in the photos.

00:01:31.946 --> 00:01:33.936
When I was actually leaning waiting

00:01:33.936 --> 00:01:36.220
it actually felt natural
and it looked natural.

00:01:36.220 --> 00:01:37.972
- The whole experience
was very uncomfortable

00:01:37.972 --> 00:01:40.823
from where to put my feet,
where to put my hands,

00:01:40.823 --> 00:01:42.857
where should I lean,
how to fold my jacket,

00:01:42.857 --> 00:01:44.947
how to everything, it was just like,

00:01:44.947 --> 00:01:46.676
it looked very uncomfortable.

00:01:46.676 --> 00:01:48.506
- It's weird 'cause your arm sometimes

00:01:48.506 --> 00:01:50.304
was squished and you didn't know it,

00:01:50.304 --> 00:01:53.866
or it felt natural but then
your shoulders are unaligned.

00:01:53.866 --> 00:01:56.796
- This pose was very awkward,
nothing felt natural to me.

00:01:56.796 --> 00:01:58.579
I kinda just did what they told me to do.

00:01:58.579 --> 00:02:01.792
- It was awkward, I did not
feel comfortable doing that.

00:02:01.792 --> 00:02:03.720
- I actually flatlined a
little bit to figure out

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:05.620
which leg I was putting in front

00:02:05.620 --> 00:02:07.312
and it's actually pretty hard.

00:02:07.312 --> 00:02:09.710
- Pose number two is
gonna be the mid-walk.

00:02:09.710 --> 00:02:11.419
Basically you're just gonna be walking

00:02:11.419 --> 00:02:13.375
and look like you're going somewhere

00:02:13.375 --> 00:02:15.697
but you're not actually going anywhere.

00:02:15.697 --> 00:02:18.026
- When I was looking off,
I was just thinkin' hmm

00:02:18.026 --> 00:02:19.711
what am I thinkin' about?

00:02:19.711 --> 00:02:22.941
But that really translates
into an awesome photo

00:02:22.941 --> 00:02:24.911
because you see the photo
and it just looks like

00:02:24.911 --> 00:02:26.949
hmm, what am I thinkin' about?

00:02:26.949 --> 00:02:29.013
- I felt super awkward,
not good at walking

00:02:29.013 --> 00:02:33.011
in my normal life so doing
it on camera was even worse.

00:02:33.011 --> 00:02:35.969
- It forces me to come out
of my element and my shell

00:02:35.969 --> 00:02:37.281
'cause I feel like it's easy to take one

00:02:37.281 --> 00:02:38.114
when no one's watching.

00:02:38.114 --> 00:02:40.561
Is it weird that I actually enjoyed it?

00:02:40.561 --> 00:02:42.926
- Just the act of moving
was really awkward for me.

00:02:42.926 --> 00:02:43.827
I don't know why?

00:02:43.827 --> 00:02:45.575
I'm also just dressed up to the nines

00:02:45.575 --> 00:02:47.822
and this is not who I am.

00:02:47.822 --> 00:02:49.179
- This is really hard.

00:02:49.179 --> 00:02:51.949
Pretending to walk is harder
than actually walking.

00:02:51.949 --> 00:02:54.606
You kinda forget how to walk.

00:02:54.606 --> 00:02:56.412
- It didn't feel as awkward
as I thought it would be,

00:02:56.412 --> 00:02:58.828
especially after seeing
all the guys do it.

00:02:58.828 --> 00:03:00.932
People were definitely looking
'cause we were all dressed up

00:03:00.932 --> 00:03:02.396
but we were all together.

00:03:02.396 --> 00:03:03.671
It made it much easier.

00:03:03.671 --> 00:03:05.222
- Pose three, adjusting your clothes.

00:03:05.222 --> 00:03:07.032
Shows that you're
fashionable so it looks like

00:03:07.032 --> 00:03:08.786
you're thinking about your clothes.

00:03:08.786 --> 00:03:10.414
All you wanna do is just look good.

00:03:10.414 --> 00:03:12.168
- It's funny 'cause
there's only so many things

00:03:12.168 --> 00:03:13.001
that guys can do.

00:03:13.001 --> 00:03:15.213
You can either button
a jacket, fix your tie,

00:03:15.213 --> 00:03:17.045
and that's it.

00:03:17.045 --> 00:03:21.258
- I feel like I really enjoyed
playing with the watch pose.

00:03:21.258 --> 00:03:23.235
- We always see those
photos, for some reason

00:03:23.235 --> 00:03:24.870
something's always wrong
with their cufflink

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:26.744
but I like it, it's simple.

00:03:26.744 --> 00:03:28.165
- Very happy that I did this.

00:03:28.165 --> 00:03:30.915
I feel like I've learned so much.

00:03:32.084 --> 00:03:33.794
- I didn't know what to do with my hands

00:03:33.794 --> 00:03:35.242
and that was really uncomfortable.

00:03:35.242 --> 00:03:38.860
I think I'd be very good without arms.

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:40.422
- The poses that I enjoyed the most

00:03:40.422 --> 00:03:43.473
were ones where it involved
a lot of accessories.

00:03:43.473 --> 00:03:45.655
I think I got to hide
behind things and it made me

00:03:45.655 --> 00:03:47.310
feel like it wasn't really about me

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:50.737
but it was more so about the look.

00:03:50.737 --> 00:03:51.891
- I was actually surprised.

00:03:51.891 --> 00:03:53.913
I'm kinda an awkward
person, I didn't expect

00:03:53.913 --> 00:03:56.023
to feel good so the
pictures it was like oh

00:03:56.023 --> 00:03:56.922
that's not that bad, I'd hit that.

00:03:56.922 --> 00:03:59.289
(soft instrumental music)

00:03:59.289 --> 00:04:01.392
- After I posted the
photos my like gain was up

00:04:01.392 --> 00:04:03.958
at least over 100, huge difference for me.

00:04:03.958 --> 00:04:06.146
- My highest liked photo was the one

00:04:06.146 --> 00:04:09.700
where I was like walking and
fixing an item of clothing.

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:11.238
482 likes.

00:04:11.238 --> 00:04:14.140
- They're hitting over
300, pretty solid increase

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:16.046
of over 100 on each of these photos.

00:04:16.046 --> 00:04:18.557
- This one particular picture
where I'm fake walking,

00:04:18.557 --> 00:04:20.028
315 likes.

00:04:20.028 --> 00:04:23.454
- I had 413 likes and over 28 comments.

00:04:23.454 --> 00:04:26.611
- The comments were
"oh my goodness, nice!"

00:04:26.611 --> 00:04:28.032
the praying hand.

00:04:28.032 --> 00:04:30.167
- "Damn, are you famous now?"

00:04:30.167 --> 00:04:32.379
"There's more to life
than being really really

00:04:32.379 --> 00:04:34.149
really ridiculously good looking."

00:04:34.149 --> 00:04:36.653
- "Damn, Dad, oh my God, va va voom."

00:04:36.653 --> 00:04:39.168
- These last two photos
I was hesitant to post

00:04:39.168 --> 00:04:41.495
'cause I didn't think I
looked the greatest in them

00:04:41.495 --> 00:04:43.618
and I posted them and they
both put up great numbers

00:04:43.618 --> 00:04:44.451
in the like gain.

00:04:44.451 --> 00:04:46.480
- And it actually did make
me feel more confident

00:04:46.480 --> 00:04:48.568
about having a bald head now.

00:04:48.568 --> 00:04:50.081
When I had nice photos of it you're like

00:04:50.081 --> 00:04:51.718
oh you know, I can rock it.

00:04:51.718 --> 00:04:54.340
- You're also really quick
to pick out your own flaws.

00:04:54.340 --> 00:04:55.797
Those might not be
there, they might just be

00:04:55.797 --> 00:04:58.447
in your own head and other
people aren't gonna see that.

00:04:58.447 --> 00:05:00.318
Before I had no idea
what to do with my hands.

00:05:00.318 --> 00:05:01.338
Or even smile.

00:05:01.338 --> 00:05:04.495
Now that I know if I just look like this,

00:05:04.495 --> 00:05:06.690
like that is the pose every time.

00:05:06.690 --> 00:05:08.217
I had so many people text me,

00:05:08.217 --> 00:05:10.125
why is your watch always broken?

00:05:10.125 --> 00:05:11.175
(laughing)

00:05:11.175 --> 00:05:12.931
(hinges squeaking)
(upbeat music)

